=== (1) symbolic: both conventions give eps6 = (R_sd/R)^6 and r = (R_sd/R)^2 ===
eps6 - (Rsd/R)^6 = 0
r    - (Rsd/R)^2 = 0
minisuperspace convention ell = lambda: C_ms = (R_sd/lambda)^2; C_ms = 1 <=> R_sd = lambda
momentum-space convention ell = R0    : C_mom = (R_sd/R0)^2;   C_mom = 1 <=> R_sd = R0
cap: P_ms - hbar R_sd^2/(lambda^2 R) = 0
cap: P_mom - hbar R_sd^2/(lambda^2 R) = 0
=> one physical point per (lambda, R_sd); 'C = 1' names R_sd = lambda (ms) or R_sd = R0 (mom).

=== (2) numbers ===
l_P = 1.61626e-35 m; lambda2 = sqrt(l_P c/H0) = 4.70989e-5 m; a_BBN = 1.6764e-10; a_end = 1.3659e-29

|Omega_k| = 0.01: R0 = 1.3725e+27 m, R(1 MeV) = 2.301e+17 m, R_end = 0.01875 m
  R_sd upper: BBN (eps6<=0.1) 1.568e+17 m; BBN (Alvey eps6<=0.064) 1.455e+17 m; N_eff (|Omega_kt|<4.871e-6) 3.029e+25 m
  R_sd upper, standard inflation (R_sd < R at pivot exit, N_* = 50): 3.616e-24 m
  R_sd upper, standard inflation (R_sd < R at pivot exit, N_* = 55): 2.436e-26 m
  R_sd upper, standard inflation (R_sd < R at pivot exit, N_* = 60): 1.642e-28 m
  ms C=1, lambda=l_P (R_sd = l_P): Delta N_eff = -1.122e-121; eps6(1 MeV) = 1.202e-313; cap n_max (lambda = l_P) = 3.142 vs n_CMB = 4.413e+30
  mom C=1 (R_sd = R0): Delta N_eff = -808.9; eps6(1 MeV) = 4.506e+58; cap n_max (lambda = l_P) = 2.265e+124 vs n_CMB = 4.413e+30
  cap from CMB photons (n = 4.413e+30): R_sd >= lambda sqrt(n/pi); survives N_eff+BBN iff lambda <= 132.3 m; + standard inflation (N_*=55) iff lambda <= 2.056e-41 m = 1.272e-6 l_P
  cap from LHC 6.8 TeV (n = 4.73e+46): R_sd >= lambda sqrt(n/pi); survives N_eff+BBN iff lambda <= 1.278e-6 m; + standard inflation (N_*=55) iff lambda <= 1.986e-49 m = 1.229e-14 l_P
  cap from UHECR 3.2e20 eV (n = 2.226e+54): R_sd >= lambda sqrt(n/pi); survives N_eff+BBN iff lambda <= 1.862e-10 m; + standard inflation (N_*=55) iff lambda <= 2.895e-53 m = 1.791e-18 l_P
  lambda = l_P: R_sd window (LHC cap .. BBN) = [1.983e-12, 1.568e+17] m -> open; inflation needs R_sd < 2.44e-26 m, CMB-photon cap alone already needs R_sd >= 1.916e-20 m -> a^-6 term dominates at pivot exit
  lambda = lambda2: R_sd window (LHC cap .. BBN) = [5.779e+18, 1.568e+17] m -> EMPTY; inflation needs R_sd < 2.44e-26 m, CMB-photon cap alone already needs R_sd >= 5.582e+10 m -> a^-6 term dominates at pivot exit

